# Task: Recompute digest + update registry for Speckit addin

## Goal
Ensure the addin registry digest matches the updated `speckit.zip` artifact.

## Steps
1. Compute sha256 for `Addins/Speckit/speckit.zip`.
2. Update the `digest` field in the Speckit addin registry entry.
3. Confirm paths (artifact/manifest/attestation) are still correct.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Digest matches
- [ ] Addin can be installed without checksum errors
